Third-party software notice

This repository vendors kRPC C-Nano 0.6.0 and nanopb 0.4.9.1 under
`ThirdParty/`. Their upstream license files and notices remain authoritative.
The desktop UI depends on PyQt6 through `PyQtApp/requirements.txt` and installs
that dependency into an isolated UI virtual environment.

The production landing backend has no Python kRPC dependency. The optional
`Tools/ksp_test_guard.py` live-test safety utility is intentionally separate
from the landing runtime and may use a separately installed Python kRPC client;
set `KSP_LANDER_GUARD_PYTHON` to that interpreter when using the guard.
